{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "c0425d38b255e2ae8fa198f3d587f2b456d46cf6381551b2e60e4eb5ec1ad827", "ja": "あれ……？\n口笛って、けっこう難しいなぁ……。", "zh": "咦……？\n原来吹口哨还挺难的啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "b622162dce7ec0f4d6549fa4820b92234319f85e50c4a150403def6845876ab3", "ja": "ふひゅー……ひゅー……。\n♪～　あ、吹けた！", "zh": "呜呼……呜呼……。\n♪～啊，吹出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "469e348054ff02dcbc65ae4f0fbf5672f62b355475f6bc715ba509c83016352a", "ja": "おはようございます、青羽さん。\n近頃はだいぶ暖かくなってきましたね。", "zh": "早上好，青羽小姐。\n最近天气暖和了不少呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "18b3d3d87557b5763d71da84cdb75ad78a8a594b80e0e8c0b159ca57469cc754", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}さん！\n今の、今の聞こえてましたか？", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生！\n刚才的，你听到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f13d78319633c6d81ea4631808949f32c70e8eb637d73a60adc1d60c18666a3a", "ja": "青羽さんのうきうきした声なら、少しだけ。\nその気持ち、わかりますよ。春ですしね。", "zh": "青羽小姐那种兴高采烈的声音，我只听到了一点。你的心情我能理解。毕竟是春天嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "e953ecdbc046d0a88d6081977b0da0097ade75ae0b9662d128fe796285e7f481", "ja": "そ、そうじゃなくて……ちょっと待ってください。\nひゅー、ふしゅー……あれぇ？", "zh": "不、不是那样……请稍等一下。\n呼——呼——……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "a0ea03631f5e7272b72b7ed31974384c8af910ae68515dd380f76fe22ff5a0b3", "ja": "おかしいな、さっきはちゃんと吹けたのに……う～ん。\nごめんなさい、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "奇怪，刚才明明还能好好吹响的……嗯～。\n对不起，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3aa302dd14b1c1d3d4a2d3bfaf6664eec62f9bcb2a952d94c5e9a100bad3761a", "ja": "ええと……？　とりあえず、ゆっくりで大丈夫ですよ。\nこの後、特に急ぎの用事があるわけでもないので。", "zh": "那个……？总之，慢慢来就好，不用着急。\n之后也没有什么特别紧急的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "94dc6d896b8336df36292e2e0c3d04fd555a763f69c9dbf0a842474ad9de2a10", "ja": "用事……あっ、そうだった！　社長さんが、\n{$P$}さんを呼んでるんでした！", "zh": "事情……啊，对了！社长正在叫{$P$}先生呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4719176732a35d4d14bd65acbaf69f4ad53023f6c104989d7f47747672b9ebd4", "ja": "社長が？　わかりました、行ってきます。\nあ、ところで青羽さんの用事は……。", "zh": "社长找我？好的，我这就去。\n啊，对了，青羽小姐有什么事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "65302b2a2286f167c621ef140e5bde0bce6373c12b73a0c7c5575d3ef510de7f", "ja": "あっ、私のは、それこそ急ぎの用じゃないので……！\n遠慮なく、社長さんのところへ行ってください！", "zh": "啊，我这边真的不是什么要紧的事……！\n您别顾虑我，快去社长那边吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "087df2ca01479a3d5fce14c8c1d383553bd3736e28442b60fab7e61d38189b3a", "ja": "そうですか？\nじゃあ、ちょっと出かけてきますね。", "zh": "这样啊？\n那我就先出去一趟啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "0cc5edc56c1001f17ecd6ad9fe7c4a6a6fa64326591f6c6233a838a947f50dd7", "ja": "はい。お気をつけて、いってらっしゃ～い！\n……上手に吹けるように、練習しておかなくっちゃ！", "zh": "好的。路上小心，慢走呀——！\n……得提前练习，争取能吹得好才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "23349f2e3d85aa4021e9adbb66fb6500f676fdbd73caa8a7fa238dab498c0ddd", "ja": "社長、お疲れさまです。\n急用だとうかがいましたが……。", "zh": "社长，您辛苦了。\n听说有急事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "1b00e7c5c77da1116d3e859d02be8abd43f1628497f10751ccf6ac2985bb8319", "ja": "やあ君、よく来てくれたね！\nまあまあ、そこに掛けてくれたまえ。", "zh": "嗨，你来了啊！\n来来，请坐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "8a617ef7c1d03297d625846eada35f48f56676c8a1f0a4098a0bb8cb32ac1a21", "ja": "こんにちは、{$P$}さん。\nちょうどお茶が入ったところなんですよ、どうぞ。", "zh": "你好，{$P$}先生。\n茶刚泡好，请用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ab09a1520bcb225d069a82a5dee8190706a9f47cfa47eec23a5a6760121a3120", "ja": "ありがとうございます、音無さん。\nお、今日のお茶請けは桜餅ですか。", "zh": "谢谢你，音无小姐。\n哦，今天的茶点是樱饼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "4e831621fd4a9d36282e3b041b762beb1aecaaabbcc77238d69db6e61d1ba45a", "ja": "ええ、近所の和菓子屋さんに並んでいたんです。\n季節のものですから、つい。", "zh": "是啊，附近的和果子店里摆出来了。既然是应季的东西，就忍不住买了些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "632d4dcd7d18579c89efe3d122cf910b2d2cae0c535dfb6a94056b282d00895f", "ja": "いいですね、春めいていて。\nお花見も本番って感じですし。", "zh": "真不错呢，很有春天的气息。\n也感觉正式迎来了赏花的季节。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "0610e7f09c2513d1b8789ece8046f29d4b0165bc9d85f85c27ba7ee850d2ec88", "ja": "シーズンの売りを的確に捉える……うむ！\nやはりあの企画には、君が適任だな！", "zh": "准确把握本赛季的卖点……嗯！\n果然，那个企划还是你最合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "ad4e97d076ab5c064f14d0ee9eab06a92026c912b257981b86b3aabe64856162", "ja": "あの企画？", "zh": "那个企划？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "f5259683126afa052636b0d5178e1dbd1058bc629d9491d6172c580dce1504ec", "ja": "今度、野外音楽会場でライブイベントが\n行われるんだが……うちにもオファーが来ていてね。", "zh": "下次要在户外音乐会场举办现场活动……我们这边也收到了邀请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "b39d9645635a459cf1e6de0320a4dc71b0e6338e9b7d54834584d632d5403a68", "ja": "この会場、お花見コンサートとか吹奏楽の大会とか\nよくやってますよね。雰囲気がとっても素敵で♪", "zh": "这个会场经常举办赏花音乐会和管乐比赛呢。气氛特别棒♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "3c69ce097d1d0c7012cd2dc686402c4843067d23c24176eec1c5de14611245fc", "ja": "確かに、いい会場ですね。\n広々してて、爽やかというか……。", "zh": "确实，这是个不错的场地呢。\n宽敞开阔，感觉很清爽……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "a00178bb2582fdc88cf5b31bf2478a2b90c292ad2f2eafcc14aff2fdb31aadc7", "ja": "うむ、悪くないだろう？　それに、この\nライブイベントはDVD化が既に決定していてね。", "zh": "嗯，挺不错的吧？而且，这场\n演唱会活动已经决定要制作成DVD了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "09a69956dc52502e794313a226d87d08c127c554be814f0372d1f5c6fdca7be1", "ja": "DVDの特典映像にも、是非参加して欲しいと\n打診されているんだが、どうかね？", "zh": "对方探了探口风，希望务必也能参与\nDVD的特典影像录制，你觉得如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "d9b5bdec7fdfd9cf55ac0625b81e60fed14f5b7791036bfad2f8fbb2813b85a9", "ja": "なるほど……ライブと同時に、アイドルの\n色々な魅力を届けられるというわけですね。", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，能在直播的同时，展现偶像们各式各样的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_1029", "source_sha256": "36c22d7e197012a55e8ff5bb4af1beef70b99abc089af9169ee00a17a4b0026a", "ja": "やります！", "zh": "我要做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b5fb4fdc325e03f84f7664daa1065adebb237759ceb12bfd4572f682459f2ded", "ja": "とても面白い企画だと思います！\nぜひやらせてもらえればと！", "zh": "我觉得这是个非常有意思的企划！\n请务必让我参加！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "2e0c913387dfe66d7a2e436bac8e8313c20b601cb65c4feb59fa36f84c3fd29b", "ja": "いやぁ、そう言ってくれると思ったよ！\n早速だが、もう新曲も用意してある。これだ！", "zh": "哎呀，我就知道你会这么说的！\n事不宜迟，新歌也已经准备好了。就是这首！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "2d1a3ed57cbe4e52e106000a20ebe39a1eaa7130acfe71e07757f317bfaef8f1", "ja": "おお……聞いていて楽しくなる曲ですね。\n心が弾む感じがします！", "zh": "哦……这首歌听起来就让人觉得很开心呢。\n感觉心情都雀跃起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_2004_president", "source_sha256": "75a2fbb55b908e2ccb3fe55cf3f455295435039785d946f8b021efd53a703f03", "ja": "この曲を歌うメンバーとイベント公演については、\n君に一任しよう！　特典映像の内容も含めてね。", "zh": "演唱这首歌的成员和活动演出就全权交给你了！包括特典影像的内容哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_2005_president", "source_sha256": "147964f8e5a75c605b52ab0bb796fbf6943fc39a637bedd3c066ba1b847ed20e", "ja": "劇場のアイドル諸君の魅力……それを\nまだ知らない人達にも、存分に伝えてきてくれたまえ！", "zh": "剧场偶像们的魅力……就把这份魅力充分传达给那些还不了解他们的人吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_2006_p", "source_sha256": "a73f73cee9a96bcd9a35ae390992895be2eab5b6827137eebadd31d9cfbb5272", "ja": "はい！　このイベント公演と特典映像で、\n新しいファンを増やしてみせます！", "zh": "好的！我一定会通过这次活动公演和特典影像，吸引更多新粉丝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_2007_101kot", "source_sha256": "9af6753d6354ba7092a625bfa8c45cc946870b27694560c5e05b343bc4aa968e", "ja": "{$P$}さん。私にも協力できる\nことがあったら、遠慮なく仰ってくださいね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生。如果有什么我能帮上忙的，\n请尽管吩咐哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_2008_p", "source_sha256": "7cfcfe1746d3194b45bbdd08815b01ef9c4e33ef18887c2f09f39f93aec752eb", "ja": "ありがとうございます、音無さん！", "zh": "谢谢你，音无女士！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_intro_2009_101kot", "source_sha256": "8f52cf8b3de1cf1c806638d2c9678ca28195a78fec8ad146b2b9a09135df2f21", "ja": "もし、もし{$P$}さんがどうしても\nと仰るなら……不肖音無小鳥、歌う覚悟で……！", "zh": "如果、如果您无论如何都坚持要{$P$}先生的话……不才音无小鸟，也做好唱歌的觉悟了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
